UID:a-rimbaud-2026-10-20-18:00:00
DESCRIPTION:Patrick Wang\, United States & Canada\, 2026\, 175 min\, in En
 glish and French with English subtitles\n\nThe improbable life of French p
 oet Arthur Rimbaud unfolds with all the shock and playfulness of his poetr
 y.\n\nEstimated start: 18:20\n\nhttps://nwfilmforum.org/films/a-rimbaud/
LOCATION:Northwest Film Forum\, 1515 12th Ave\, Seattle\, WA 98122
