BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Chronovisor
DTSTART:20261005T193000
DTEND:20261005T213000
DTSTAMP:20261005T193000Z
UID:chronovisor-2026-10-05-19:30:00
DESCRIPTION:Jack Auen\, Kevin Walker\, United States\, 2026\, 100 min\, in
  English\, German\, Italian\, and French with English subtitles\n\nWhile w
 riting a monograph on historical theories of memory\, Béatrice (Anne-Laur
 e Sellier)\, a respected academic\, becomes beguiled by the allegedly true
  story of the Chronovisor\, an occult device said to reproduce visuals fro
 m any point in history on a TV screen. Her obsession with the mysterious m
 achine drags her from her Upper East Side apartment through the depths of 
 New York City’s hidden libraries\, to the edge of a breakthrough.\n\n“
 Don’t miss CHRONOVISOR all hail CHRONOVISOR” — Jane Schoenbrun (dire
 ctor\, Teenage Sex and Death at Camp Miasma)\n\nSynopsis courtesy of Grass
 hopper Film\n\nEstimated start: 19:50\n\nhttps://nwfilmforum.org/films/chr
 onovisor/
LOCATION:Northwest Film Forum\, 1515 12th Ave\, Seattle\, WA 98122
END:VEVENT
