END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Once Upon a Time In Seattle
DTSTART:20261101T160000
DTEND:20261101T180500
DTSTAMP:20261101T160000Z
UID:once-upon-time-seattle-2026-11-01-16:00:00
DESCRIPTION:Collide-O-Scope\, 2026\, United States\, 101 min\, in English
 \n\nSPECIAL NOVEMBER 2026 EDITION! ALREADY UPDATED FROM THE SEPTEMBER 2026
  EDITION! \n\nComprised of moments from over 40 films shot in Seattle\, an
 d a few irresistible facsimiles\, Once Upon a Time in Seattle is part love
  letter\, part loony action adventure\, and part free-associative meditati
 on on the transience of landscape in a city that has always had a complica
 ted relationship with honoring its past while moving swiftly (recklessly?)
  into the future.\n\nThere is no linear narrative\, and dialogue is kept t
 o a minimum. The city itself is both location and protagonist\, while the 
 function of the human characters\, or perhaps more accurately\, ciphers\, 
 is that of a vessel to move us through the city and occasionally offer loo
 se context or comic relief. With one exception\, no single existing shot o
 r sequence is sustained longer than a minute\, with most individual shots 
 lasting less than 20 seconds\, and over half clocking in at 5 seconds or l
 ess. The result is a deceptively complex amalgamation of wholly unrelated 
 material\, and an impressively unique editorial/directorial achievement.\n
 \nSurprisingly weaving numerous throughlines from the many disparate exist
 ing narratives\, while leaving much open to the viewer’s interpretation
 \, scene chronology floats between seemingly non sequitur\, to surprisingl
 y\, quietly poignant\, depending on the viewer’s own history with the ci
 ty. A hyper-local\, one-of-a-kind film experience and an opportunity to ex
 amine Seattle’s ever-changing landscape as seen through the camera lens
 \, Once Upon a Time in Seattle offers a unique portal to examine our city
 ’s topography (and vibe!) of the past\, both near and distant.\n\nEstima
 ted start: 16:20\n\nhttps://nwfilmforum.org/films/once-upon-time-seattle/
LOCATION:Northwest Film Forum\, 1515 12th Ave\, Seattle\, WA 98122
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
